{

	10_1: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: decipher/LOTR10001.jpg
			collInfo: 10R1
			rarity: R
		}
		title: Great Day, Great Hour
		unique: false
		side: Free Peoples
		culture: Dwarven
		twilight: 3
		type: Event
		timewords: Response
		effects: {
			type: responseEvent
			trigger: {
				type: played
				filter: not(your),minion
				memorize: playedMinion
			}
			cost: [
				{
					type: spot
					select: choose(dwarf,damage,CanExert)
					memorize: exertedDwarf
					text: Choose a Dwarf to exert
				}
				{
					// X is the damage bonus the Dwarf has when he is chosen: it is remembered before he
					// exerts, and what the exertion does to him does not change it (Q-0256; as the erratum of
					// Blood Runs Chill, 58_3).
					type: memorizeNumber
					amount: {
						type: forEachKeywordOnCardInMemory
						memory: exertedDwarf
						keyword: damage
					}
					memory: damageBonus
				}
				{
					// A remembered Dwarf cannot be judged beforehand as a cost, so his exertion goes through
					// costToEffect (the choice above has already asked for a Dwarf able to exert).
					type: costToEffect
					effect: {
						type: exert
						select: memory(exertedDwarf)
					}
				}
			]
			effect: [
				{
					type: exert
					select: memory(playedMinion)
					times: {
						type: fromMemory
						memory: damageBonus
					}
				}
			]
		}
		gametext: If an opponent plays a minion, exert a Dwarf who is damage +X to exert that minion X times.
		lore: "'Oft hope is born, when all is forlorn.'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	10_2: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: decipher/LOTR10002.jpg
			collInfo: 10U2
			rarity: U
		}
		title: Memories of Darkness
		unique: true
		side: Free Peoples
		culture: Dwarven
		twilight: 1
		type: Condition
		keywords: Support Area
		effects: [
			{
				type: toPlay
				requires: {
					type: canSpot
					filter: dwarf
				}
			}
			{
				type: Trigger
				optional: true
				trigger: {
					type: losesInitiative
					side: free people
				}
				requires: {
					type: not
					requires: {
						type: phase
						phase: fellowship
					}
				}
				effect: {
					type: choice
					texts: [
						Play a {dwarven} condition from hand
						Play a {dwarven} condition from discard
					]
					effects: [
						{
							type: PlayCardFromHand
							select: choose(culture(dwarven),condition)
						}
						{
							type: playCardFromDiscard
							select: choose(culture(dwarven),condition)
						}
					]
				}
			}
		]
		gametext: To play, spot a Dwarf.<br>Each time you lose initiative (except during the fellowship phase), you may play a [dwarven] condition from hand or from your discard pile.
		lore: "'Had I known what was before me, I think that not for any friendship would I have taken the Paths of the Dead.'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

	10_3: {
		cardInfo: {
			image: decipher/LOTR10003.jpg
			collInfo: 10R3
			rarity: R
		}
		title: More Yet to Come
		unique: false
		side: Free Peoples
		culture: Dwarven
		twilight: 0
		type: Event
		timewords: Response
		effects: {
			type: responseEvent
			trigger: {
				type: Killed
				filter: minion
				killer: dwarf
				inSkirmish: true
				memorize: killedMinion
			}
			text: Play More Yet to Come for {killedMinion}
			requires: {
				type: killedWithSurplusDamage
				memorize: surplusDamage
			}
			effect: [
				{
					type: repeat
					times: {
						type: fromMemory
						memory: surplusDamage
					}
					effect: {
						type: wound
						select: choose(minion,notAssignedToSkirmish)
					}
				}
				{
					type: consumeSurplusDamage
				}
			]
		}
		gametext: If a Dwarf kills a minion in a skirmish and that minion did not take all wounds caused by that Dwarf's damage bonus, assign those remaining wounds to minions not assigned to a skirmish.
		lore: "'...whatever is still to do, I hope to have a part in it, for the honour of the folk of the Lonely Mountain.'"
		promotext: ""
		alts: {
			promos: {
			}
			errata: {
			}
		}
	}

}
